/**
* @defgroup fake_stream_adapter fake stream adapter
* @ingroup test_support_reference
*
* @brief Test double for `stream` adapter.
*
* @details
* Provides reusable test support for constructing `stream` instances backed
* by configurable fake adapters.
*
* The module exposes fake adapter providers for dynamic-buffer, regular-file,
* and standard-stream creators. Each provider uses a common fake backend
* implementation whose read, write, flush, close, and construction behavior
* can be configured and observed by tests.
*
* Sequential constructor controls allow successive backend creations to use
* independent configurations and expose the arguments received from the
* corresponding `stream` creator.
*
* The fake backend also maintains bounded input, buffered-output, and sink
* state so tests can exercise and inspect stream I/O behavior without relying
* on concrete production adapters.
*/
